<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="1 Overview" id="1 Overview"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="3000"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="Final plan: App is the hub. Devices send EVENTS, App sends short COMMANDS" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Manikin IoT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Events (to App)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 compression: -1 recoil failed, 0 idle, 1 shallow, 2 good&lt;br&gt;2 breath: 1 for 0.5 s then 0&lt;br&gt;3 heart mode: 0 off, 1 normal pulse&lt;br&gt;4 padChest (= padLeft): 0 / 1&lt;br&gt;5 padHip (= padRight): 0 / 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Commands (from App)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C or ? : announce&lt;br&gt;A0 / A1 : pad listener off / on&lt;br&gt;B0 / B1 : breath listener off / on&lt;br&gt;H0 / H1 : heart stopped / normal 72 bpm" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="330" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Mobile App&lt;/b&gt; (hub)&lt;br&gt;pairs both devices&lt;br&gt;checks pads, decides when to send S1&lt;br&gt;sends P0 after shock delivered&lt;br&gt;sets heart mode H0 / H1 at the end of the session from the result" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="150" width="260" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;AED IoT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Events (to App)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 power: 0 button off, 1 waiting for press, 2 power on&lt;br&gt;2 shock: 0 button off, 1 waiting for press, 2 in progress, 3 delivered&lt;br&gt;(power 0 forces shock 0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Commands (from App)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C or ? : announce&lt;br&gt;P0 / P1 : power button disable / enable&lt;br&gt;S0 / S1 : shock button disable / enable&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fail-safe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;link lost -&gt; back to power 0 / shock 0" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="80" width="330" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="events" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="370" y="235" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="420" y="235" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="cmds" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="420" y="270" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="370" y="270" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="events" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="680" y="235" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="730" y="235" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="cmds" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="730" y="270" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="680" y="270" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Devices never talk to each other. Pads are read by the Manikin, the App reads them and decides to send S1 to the AED.&lt;br&gt;2. Event based: send only when a value changes. On connect (notify enabled) each device sends its current values once (snapshot).&lt;br&gt;3. Link is bonded and encrypted (LE Secure Connections). Shock needs two physical presses: power button, then shock button.&lt;br&gt;4. The old command letters are replaced by this new set (A, B, H, C, P, S). Old App must be updated together." style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="1020" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="2 AED State Machine" id="2 AED State Machine"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="3000"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="AED: power and shock state machine (App command + user button press)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="IDLE&lt;br&gt;power 0, shock 0&lt;br&gt;LED off" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="POWER ENABLED&lt;br&gt;power 1 (wait for press)&lt;br&gt;shock 0&lt;br&gt;LED off" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="100" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="POWER ON&lt;br&gt;power 2, shock 0&lt;br&gt;LED yellow" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="100" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="SHOCK READY&lt;br&gt;power 2, shock 1 (wait for press)&lt;br&gt;LED yellow" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="100" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="SHOCKING&lt;br&gt;shock 2 in progress&lt;br&gt;yellow, then red blink 5 s" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="100" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="App: P1" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="230" y="150" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="260" y="150" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="user presses power button" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="450" y="150" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="480" y="150" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="App: S1 (only if power 2)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="670" y="150" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="700" y="150" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="user presses shock button" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="890" y="150" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="920" y="150" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="DELIVERED&lt;br&gt;shock 3&lt;br&gt;LED green" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="300" width="190" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="5 s sequence ends" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1015" y="200" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1015" y="300" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="App: P0 (any time)&lt;br&gt;power 0, shock 0, LED off" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="after delivered, App sends P0" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="920" y="345" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="340" y="345" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;P1 only enables the power button. Nothing happens until the user presses it.&lt;br&gt;S1 is accepted only when power is 2. Otherwise it is ignored and the current state is sent again.&lt;br&gt;S0 disables the shock button (shock back to 0, power stays 2).&lt;br&gt;P0 forces power 0 and shock 0 from any state, and stops a running sequence.&lt;br&gt;Link lost, or AED restarted: back to power 0, shock 0 (fail-safe).&lt;br&gt;While power is 1 the shock button is dead. While shock is 0 the shock button is dead.&lt;br&gt;After delivered (3) the shock button is disabled; only P0 or P1 changes the state." style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="1070" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="3 Session Sequence" id="3 Session Sequence"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="3000"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="Session sequence: pairing done to shock delivered" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1000" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="App" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="60" width="160" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="100" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="1400" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Manikin" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="60" width="160" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="100" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="1400" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="AED" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="60" width="160" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="100" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1060" y="1400" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="1. After pairing: notify enabled on both. Each device sends its current values once (snapshot)." style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="118" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="C  (announce request)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="170" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="170" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="ANNOUNCE (name, battery, firmware)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="210" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="210" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="C  (announce request)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="250" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1060" y="250" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="ANNOUNCE (name, battery, firmware)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="290" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="290" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="2. Session start" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="318" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="A1  (pad listener on)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="370" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="370" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="B1  (breath listener on)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="410" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="410" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="H1  (heart normal 72 bpm)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="450" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="450" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="padChest / padHip events (0 or 1) on change" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="490" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="490" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="heart mode 1" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="530" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="530" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="3. CPR: events only" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="558" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="compression -1 / 0 / 1 / 2 (each compression)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="610" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="610" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="breath 1 (0.5 s) then 0" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="650" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="650" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="4. AED powered on by the user" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="678" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="P1  (enable power button)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="730" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1060" y="730" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="power 1 (waiting for press)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="770" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="770" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="user presses power button: LED yellow" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="796" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="power 2 (on)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="850" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="850" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="check padChest = 1 and padHip = 1 (from Manikin)" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="876" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="S1  (enable shock button)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="930" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1060" y="930" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="shock 1 (waiting for press)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="970" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="970" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="user presses shock: yellow -&gt; red blink 5 s" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="996" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="shock 2 (in progress)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="1050" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="1050" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="sequence ends: LED green" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="1076" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="shock 3 (delivered)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="1130" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="1130" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="P0  (power + shock buttons off)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="1170" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1060" y="1170" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="power 0, shock 0" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1060" y="1210" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="1210" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="5. Session result known: App sets heart mode on the Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1238" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="H0 or H1 (based on result)" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="220" y="1290" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="640" y="1290" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="heart mode 0 / 1" style="endArrow=block;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#006600;fontColor=#006600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640" y="1330" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="220" y="1330" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="Fail-safe: if App link drops at any time, AED returns to power 0 / shock 0" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1358" width="1000" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="4 Packet Format" id="4 Packet Format"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="3000"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="Event packet: existing 15-byte CprPacket, new type codes (value in byte 10)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Header: magic C9 C2 | version | type | timestamp (4 B) | id (2 B)  then  value (1 B) | deviceID (3 B) | checksum (1 B)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="1060" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Device" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Event" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="110" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Type" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="110" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Value" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#666666;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="110" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="146" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="compression" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="146" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="0x02 (existing)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="146" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="-1 recoil failed, 0 idle, 1 shallow, 2 good" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="146" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="182" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="breath" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="182" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="0x05 (existing)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="182" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="0 / 1 (1 held 0.5 s)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="182" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="218" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="heart mode" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="218" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="0x06 (new)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="218" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="0 off, 1 normal" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="218" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="254" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="padChest (= padLeft)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="254" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="0x07 (new)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="254" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="0 detached, 1 attached" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="254" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="Manikin" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="290" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="padHip (= padRight)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="290" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="0x08 (new)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="290" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="0 detached, 1 attached" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="290" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="AED" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="326" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="power" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="326" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="0x09 (new)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="326" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="0 off, 1 waiting for press, 2 on" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="326" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="AED" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="362" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="shock" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="362" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="0x0A (new)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="362" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="0 off, 1 waiting for press, 2 in progress, 3 delivered" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="362" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="Both" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="398" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="announce reply to C / ?" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="398" width="260" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="0x01 (existing)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="398" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="name, battery, deviceID, device type" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="398" width="460" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="&lt;b&gt;Commands&lt;/b&gt;: plain ASCII, 1 letter + 1 digit, written to the NUS RX characteristic. Unknown command: ignored.&lt;br&gt;Manikin: C ? | A0 A1 | B0 B1 | H0 H1.   AED: C ? | P0 P1 | S0 S1&lt;br&gt;Commands from anyone other than the bonded, encrypted App are rejected by the GATT permissions." style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="1060" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="5 Code Changes" id="5 Code Changes"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="3000"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="Code changes needed" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Manikin firmware&lt;/b&gt; (CPR_BLE_Zephyr_Controller_No_LED-main)&lt;br&gt;1. ble_service.c: replace the command switch with C ? A0 A1 B0 B1 H0 H1 only (remove old A2, M, E, D, K, S, B-single-beat, SHOCK_*)&lt;br&gt;2. aed_sensor.c: read padChest and padHip separately, listener on/off by A0 / A1&lt;br&gt;3. air_sensor: listener on/off by B0 / B1, send 1 then 0 after 0.5 s&lt;br&gt;4. main.c: send events heart mode, padChest, padHip on change; send snapshot when notify enabled&lt;br&gt;5. cpr_config.h: add PTYPE 0x06 heart, 0x07 padChest, 0x08 padHip&lt;br&gt;6. Remove aed_client.c/.h, aed_wire.h, central role, @ commands, shock arm / cpr_relay_aed&lt;br&gt;7. prj.conf: BT_MAX_CONN=1, SMP SC only, encrypted GATT permissions" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="520" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;AED firmware&lt;/b&gt; (CPR_Zephyr_AED_Controller-master)&lt;br&gt;1. aed_ble.c: encrypted RX / TX, enable TX notify, parse C ? P0 P1 S0 S1 (replaces E D K0 K1 A0 A1 SHOCK_*)&lt;br&gt;2. aed_button.c: power button works only when power enable = 1; shock button only when power = 2 and shock enable = 1&lt;br&gt;3. main.c: state machine from page 2, send events power and shock on every change, snapshot on notify enable&lt;br&gt;4. Shock sequence: yellow, red blink 5 s, green; report shock 2 at start and shock 3 at end&lt;br&gt;5. On disconnect or boot: power 0, shock 0, LED off, cancel any sequence&lt;br&gt;6. cpr: add PTYPE 0x09 power, 0x0A shock, reuse CprPacket builder + checksum&lt;br&gt;7. prj.conf: SMP SC only, bonding, encrypted GATT permissions" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="60" width="520" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;App&lt;/b&gt;: pair both devices, enable notify, keep latest value of every event, send A1 B1 H1 at session start, send S1 only when AED power = 2 and padChest = 1 and padHip = 1, send P0 after shock = 3, send H0 / H1 at the end from the session result. Show AED as offline if the link drops.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verification&lt;/b&gt;: use nRF Connect to send each command and check every event and LED; unplug the App mid-sequence and check AED returns to 0 / 0." style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="1080" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>